    "citations": [
      "1822"
    ]
  },
  {
    "statement": "Eight studies reported that a majority of directly planted peatland trees and shrubs survived over periods between 10 weeks and 13 years.",
    "citations": [
      "1820"
    ]
  },
  {
    "statement": "Some directly planted tree and shrub species showed less than 50% survival.",
    "citations": [
      "1820"
    ]
